# cards: an escaped battle gives no card and no recharge (docs/plan-cards.md 2.6, point 7). First temple battle,
# party2_strong: round 1 both Fight (some monsters die), then L and R are held to run. Expect: the Bealzebub
# (bag 0x0213BA12) and Thanatos (0x0213BA25) cards stay at 0 after the battle ends. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
wait 270
watch u8 0x0213ba12 bealzebub_cards
watch u8 0x0213ba25 thanatos_cards
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 3000
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 60
press L,R 240
wait 600
shot ce_end
